# Byte-for-byte stability.
#
# This repository ships SHA256SUMS.txt and a reference-value checker, so a
# clone must reproduce the committed bytes exactly on every platform. Git's
# automatic line-ending conversion would rewrite the reference outputs and
# figures (generated on Windows, so CSV and SVG carry CRLF) and every checksum
# would then fail on a Linux or macOS clone.
#
# Disabling conversion repository-wide is deliberate. Do not replace this with
# `* text=auto`.
* -text

# Mark true binaries so Git and GitHub never attempt to diff them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.gz  binary
*.zip binary
*.npz binary
*.CEL binary

# Text, but not worth a line-by-line diff in review.
*.svg -diff
penkin/data/iAL1006.xml -diff
results/*.json -diff
results/*.csv  -diff

# Repository language statistics: this is research code, not a web project.
docs/**    linguist-documentation
results/** linguist-generated
figures/** linguist-generated
